{"body":"# Read a professional's profile

## In plain words

Reads back what the [HPR](/docs/hiecm/v3/getting-started/glossary#hpr) holds for a healthcare professional. Call it before you register someone, so a professional who already has a profile is not registered again. Search by the HPR ID in `practitioner.id`, or by `name`, `contactNumber`, `state`, `registrationNumber` and `stateCouncilName`.

## How you know it worked

The response carries a `message` and the matching `practitioners`.","catalogue_version":"2026.09.16","doc_url":"/docs/hiecm/v3/api/m4/endpoints/m4-enrollment/05-m4-post-v1-doctors-fetch-professional-info#m4-hpr-fetch-professional-info","gateway":"hiecm","id":"hiecm.endpoint.m4-hpr-fetch-professional-info","milestone":"M4","operation":"m4_post_v1_doctors_fetch_professional_info","summary":"Returns what the registry holds for a healthcare professional, found by HPR ID or other details.","title":"Read a professional's profile","type":"endpoint"}
